  "description": "Dae-gyeon has a troubled relationship with his dreams. The death of his parents in a car accident has convinced him that bad luck will inevitably happen to everyone he dreams of. \n\nBut the arrival of a mysterious man in a dream upsets his certainties. Man, gifted with more than human faculties, reveals to him that he has the power to shape the dreams of others. Dae-gyeon begins to suspect that his own relationship with this dream world may be very old, very deep. What if this elsewhere really existed?",
